{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:12 2026-07-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:12 2026-07-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:12 2026-07-30 HKT</p><p>暑假期間，不少香港人藉機到日本旅遊。惟務必要留意天氣變化。有網民今日（30）入夜後時間，東京上野天氣驟變，天空更下起冰雹。</p><img alt=\"今日傍晚，東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@oniyome0201\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25ac5c0db2e014c09c942e1f453cd59f/2026-07/threadster_wsyxuiuw_mp4_snapshot_00_58__2026_07_30_21_58_03__0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"今日傍晚，東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@oniyome0201\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a51955678b2c5b5f61e6a63aaab7db8/2026-07/threadster_wsyxuiuw_mp4_snapshot_00_52__2026_07_30_21_57_53__0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"今日傍晚，東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@oniyome0201\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cb4ddee59853899050806c0334fb662/2026-07/threadster_wsyxuiuw_mp4_snapshot_00_14__2026_07_30_21_57_30__0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"今日傍晚，東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@oniyome0201\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9230b4585611ad4c2152fa1974c1436/2026-07/threadster_wsyxuiuw_mp4_snapshot_00_12__2026_07_30_21_57_25__0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@jia.shannn\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7203db664e4958cda5322dd1cbd1a01/2026-07/761179753_17976763335097608_6960988175551260381_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"東京上野天氣驟變落冰雹。threads@jia.shannn\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/836673c202771ef2f4e20748ebb34a9c/2026-07/759655484_17976763365097608_3991548928581680659_n.jpg\"/><p>網上流傳影片所見，上野天空烏黑一片，無數冰雹從天而降。有網民指，今天天氣一直很不錯，東京突然像世界末日一樣風雲變色，期間雷聲像炸彈一樣，狂風暴雨隨伴而來。由於天氣急速轉差，有商店職員讓網民入店躲避。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T14:20:33.257657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}